            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justice Stevens: \"Does that proposition settle the question whether your opponents have equitable interest in the lands?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7b71e5e2d8beed064dde295e1418f6a4a12534de208094bed020f7c713ac85a2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7b71e5e2d8be-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg: \"Why is it necessary? Why isn't it sufficient just to say that this resolution has no substantive effect, period, and then remand to the Hawaii Supreme Court?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7b71e5e2d8beed064dde295e1418f6a4a12534de208094bed020f7c713ac85a2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7b71e5e2d8be-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, justice Scalia: \"Is -- is it the function of the Hawaiian Supreme Court to declare moral obligations?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7b71e5e2d8beed064dde295e1418f6a4a12534de208094bed020f7c713ac85a2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7b71e5e2d8be-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, justice Scalia: \"You don't?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7b71e5e2d8beed064dde295e1418f6a4a12534de208094bed020f7c713ac85a2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7b71e5e2d8be-0002-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 47,
              "start": 47
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia (stated consequence): \"Presumably, according to the terms of the injunction, it would no longer have any force.\""
      }
    ],
