          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Kannon K. Shanmugam, the case concerns whether the 1993 Apology Resolution creates a federal obligation that prevents the sale of Hawaiian ceded lands."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7b71e5e2d8beed064dde295e1418f6a4a12534de208094bed020f7c713ac85a2",
            "evidence_ids": [
